## 5. The question the study answers

On Iris (OpenML 61), under 10× repeated stratified 5-fold CV with identical splits, does multinomial logistic regression differ in accuracy from k-NN with k tuned by inner CV, and by how much (paired difference with 95% interval)? Secondary, required: is the full computation reproducible across an Ibex CPU node and the local machine (node name; identical or not)?

What a reviewer should check the delivery against: §2 rows D1–P6, the interval method named and appropriate (§4), nested selection of k with no leakage, same splits for both methods, Ibex job evidence (script, job id, node, log), the identical/not statement backed by a comparison of the two result files, and every reported number traceable to code and a result file.

